    <td colspan="2"><h3>Introduction</h3>
<p>The PiVKVM V4 Plus is powerful, discreet hardware Remote-Access Tool.<br></p>
<p>Originally designed to allow system-administrators to monitor and control computers remotely, the PiKVM V4 Plus's powerful hardware makes it a perfect implant tool for pentesters and red-teams.  <br></p>
<p>Undetectable via anti-virus software or IDS systems, the PiKVM gives full control over the host hardware: keyboard, mouse, video, audio, mass-storage and more.<br></p>
<p>Connect to the device via rapidly depending on the scenario: LAN, Wifi and 4G/5G. Built on linux, with out-of the box support for Tailscale VPN, port-forwarding and Cloudflare Tunnels - punching out of firewalls for permanent connectivity is easy.</p>
<p>The PiKVM gives unprecedented low-level access to a host device: BIOS settings, and even the ability to "insert" flash-media at boot-time.</p>
<p>Protected in a rugged, professional metal case gives it the perfect cover as a "Do Not Unplug" device tucked behind a desk or in a network cupboard.</p>
<div class="grid" style="margin-top: 2em;">
<div class="grid-item small--one-whole medium--one-half large--one-half text-left">
<h3>Pass-Through HDMI<br>
</h3>
Supports full-resolution, full speed HDMI + DP (Via USB-C) Pass-through - accessible via remotel streaming on the admin console, or directly via VNC.<br>
</div>
<div class="grid-item small--one-whole medium--one-half large--one-half text-left">
<h3>Undetectable Implant<br>
</h3>
Complete low-level access to the host machine - including BIOS, Boot-Media and all peripherals - and completely undetectable by software.<br>
</div>
<div class="grid-item small--one-whole medium--one-half large--one-half text-left">
<h3>Stay Connected<br>
</h3>
Supports 4G/5G connectivity via on-board SIM-Slot, RJ45 LAN and Wifi- to ensure you retain access no matter what.<br>
</div>
<div class="grid-item small--one-whole medium--one-half large--one-half text-left">
<h3>Highly Flexible<br>
</h3>
Supports multiple installation configurations (USB Only, USB+HDMI). Emulates Netbooting, boot media, netdrives, serial-port connectivity and more.<br>
</div>
</div>
<h2 style="margin-top: 2em;">Key Features</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<strong>HDMI Capture + Passthrough: </strong>Up to 1920x1200 @ 60Hz + audio<br>
</li>
<li>Supports <strong>UEFI + BIOS control</strong>
</li>
<li>Remote emulation of <strong>keyboard / mouse / mass-storage </strong><br>
</li>
<li>Additional <strong>USB Host Support</strong>
</li>
<li>Fully-featured <strong>WebUI Panel + VNC Support</strong>
</li>
<li>Virtual CD-ROM / Flash Storage / Remote Images</li>
<li>Two-way audio with microphone</li>
<li>Firewall punch-through via <strong>Tailscale, Cloudflare Tunnels</strong>
</li>
<li>Firewall evasion with <strong>3G/4G/5G Connectivity</strong>
</li>
<li>Open source, <strong>full linux system remotely implanted.</strong><br>
</li>
</ul>
<h3><strong>Device Comparision</strong></h3>
<p>The PiKVM V4 encompasses functionality of multiple popular implant devices, while providing extra out-of-the-box functionality.</p>
